  "description": "【3000W Peak Dual Motors】Equipped with high-performance 3000W peak brushless dual motors(1500W peak * 2 ), this electric bike delivers powerful acceleration to effortlessly tackle 30° inclines, rugged trails, and city streets. It maintains sustained power up to 35 mph, letting you conquer any terrain with ease. The high-definition LCD display shows real-time speed, battery level, pedal assist level, mileage, and more, keeping you informed about your ride status even at night.\n\n【48V 19.2Ah Removable Battery】This electric bicycle features a 48V 19.2Ah lithium-ion battery (total capacity: 940Wh), delivering up to 65 miles on a single charge in pedal assist mode and up to 35 miles in pure electric mode. Charging takes approximately 5-6 hours. The removable design allows convenient charging at home, in the office, or at any standard outlet. Whether for daily commutes, weekend short trips, or longer rides, it handles them all with ease.\n\n【27.5\" x 3.0\" Fat Tires & Full Suspension】This electric mountain bike features 27.5x3.0 inch fat tires crafted from durable rubber, delivering exceptional stability and traction on gravel roads, muddy surfaces, slippery terrain, and even trails covered in a light dusting of snow. The front and rear suspension systems complement the fat tires, effectively absorbing shocks from rugged terrain and bumpy roads. No matter how long you ride, it delivers a smooth and controllable riding experience.\n\n【7-Speed Gears & 5 Riding Modes】Featuring 7-speed gearing system, this e-bike lets you adjust resistance and speed to match your riding style and terrain—from fast-paced urban commutes to slow, steady climbs. It supports 5 riding modes: pure electric mode/ pedal assist mode/ classic bike mode/ 6km/h walk assist mode/ cruise control. Flexibly meet your energy needs, making long-distance trips or daily commutes effortless.",
